<view class="screen {{theme}}"><mm-header back="{{true}}" bindback="back"/><view class="content"><mm-state busy="{{busy}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry"/><view class="eyebrow">STRUCTURE / 输入 1</view><view class="title">我的长期结构</view><block wx:if="{{ready}}"><view class="note">{{sample}} 首可见长期样本 · 按播放次数加权<view></view>合作艺人分摊一首作品的权重；不是注册以来全部历史</view><view class="card"><mm-chart kind="stat" value="{{top10Text}}" caption="前10首在长期样本中的播放份额"/><view class="grid"><view><view class="big">{{sample}}</view><view class="muted">可见样本</view></view><view><view class="big">{{essText}}</view><view class="muted">有效曲库 ESS</view></view></view></view><view class="tabs"><button wx:for="{{dims}}" wx:key="id" class="{{dimension===item.id?'selected':''}}" bindtap="dimension" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">{{item.label}}</button></view><view class="card"><mm-chart kind="bars" rows="{{chartRows}}" caption="{{caption}}"/><view wx:if="{{!chartRows.length}}" class="muted">此维度暂无可靠数据。</view></view><view wx:if="{{core.length}}" class="card"><view class="heading">代表作品</view><button wx:for="{{core}}" wx:key="id" class="list-button" bindtap="openCard">歌曲 {{item.id}} · {{item.reasons}}</button><view class="caption">代表作品来自已有卡片事实；点按查看这首歌的关系卡。</view></view><view class="actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="evidence">查看证据与来源</button><button class="link" bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/preferences/index">查看主动偏好 →</button></view></block></view></view>
